---
title: CLI update · verification and recovery
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Current
  Current --> Downloading : confirmed update
  Downloading --> Verified : layout and hashes pass
  Downloading --> Refused : transfer or integrity refusal
  Verified --> AssetsPublished : staged version passes
  AssetsPublished --> CompilerPublished : matching compiler
  CompilerPublished --> Installed : CLI rename last
  Verified --> Restored : caught failure
  AssetsPublished --> Restored : caught failure
  CompilerPublished --> Restored : caught failure
  Installed --> Restored : caught sync failure
  AssetsPublished --> Uncertain : hard kill
  CompilerPublished --> Uncertain : hard kill
  Restored --> Current : old files restored
  Refused --> Current : install unchanged
  Uncertain --> Current : retained backup recovery
  note right of Downloading
    Fresh retries share one deadline.
    Uncertain cancellation refuses retry.
  end note
  note right of Installed
    Previous files and value-free manifest retained.
    No power-loss atomicity across directories.
  end note
  class Current idle
  class Downloading,AssetsPublished,CompilerPublished live
  class Verified,Installed,Restored ok
  class Refused fail
  class Uncertain wait
